config BR2_PACKAGE_PRBOOMPLUS
	bool "prboom-plus"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SDL
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SDL_MIXER
	select BR2_PACKAGE_SDL_NET
	help
	  PrBoom+ 2.5.1.4, the last SDL 1.2 release of the maintained
	  PrBoom fork. Built alongside prboom 2.5.0 so the two engines
	  can be compared with the graphics library held constant.

	  https://github.com/coelckers/prboom-plus
